meta {
  name: Get Shared Job
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/jobs/shared/:shareToken
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  shareToken: replace-with-share-token
}

docs {
  No auth guard on purpose: this is the public endpoint behind the link
  generated by "Generate Share Link", meant to be opened by people outside
  the company without logging in. It lives on its own controller
  (PublicJobsController, route /jobs/*) so it isn't caught by the
  JwtAuthGuard + CompanyMemberGuard applied to JobsController.

  Contract input is { shareToken } from the path. Looks up a job whose
  shareToken matches AND shareTokenExpiresAt is still in the future;
  returns 500 ("Invalid or expired share token") otherwise. Note this can
  return DRAFT/ARCHIVED job details to anyone holding a valid token — by
  design, since PUBLISHED jobs are shared via the direct public job page
  instead (see "Generate Share Link").
}
